evidence = "The error propagation introduced by commit aff460c2b59d12f031b1ae3cd44ca0406050ea96 remains at storage/ledger_db/block/blocksim/blocksim.go:278, :306, :312 and :322, so the deferred diagnostic at storage/ledger_db/block/blocksim/cmd/blocksim/main.go:54 repeats and mislabels the same workload error returned at :81, while storage/ledger_db/block/blocksim/repair_m1160_test.go:99 checks propagation without asserting diagnostic counts or exercising that defer."
close_comment = "Blocksim still reports a workload failure three times, including an incorrect close-failure label. A focused follow-up will report the original failure once through the CLI result handler while preserving cleanup and a nonzero exit status."

